{"id":"92fa2b66cf33e6eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-absolute-convergence.md","title":"Absolute Convergence","display":"df-absolute-convergence — Absolute Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-absolute-convergence","aliases":["58-df-absolute-convergence"],"display":"df-absolute-convergence — Absolute Convergence","depends_on":["[[58-df-absolute-value]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-absolute-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-absolute-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-absolute-convergence — Absolute Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af0349c490d72a92\" href=\"?note=af0349c490d72a92\" title=\"58-df-absolute-value\">58-df-absolute-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,a,v,+,\\cdot,b\\in V\">\\(K,a,v,+,\\cdot,b\\in V\\)</span> (valued-field data, input sequence, value graph, and partial-sum graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (absolute-value and function predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsConv}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsConv}_S\\)</span> (absolute-convergence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_S(a,K,+,\\cdot,v)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,K)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(m)=\\sum_{n\\in m}v(a(n))\\bigr)\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(N\\subseteq m\\to|b(m)-L|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_S(a,K,+,\\cdot,v)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,K)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(m)=\\sum_{n\\in m}v(a(n))\\bigr)\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(N\\subseteq m\\to|b(m)-L|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The valuation, input sequence, and partial-sum sequence are typed function graphs; convergence is asserted of the latter rather than of an unbound finite-sum metaterm.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-absolute-value","status":"resolved","id":"af0349c490d72a92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-absolute-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,a,v,+,\\cdot,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsConv}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_S(a,K,+,\\cdot,v)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,K)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(m)=\\sum_{n\\in m}v(a(n))\\bigr)\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(N\\subseteq m\\to|b(m)-L|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1257,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-absolute-convergence.md|58-df-absolute-convergence]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["af0349c490d72a92","36d7463d215be751"]}